    ledgerNote: T('关于量子计算机的常见说法，证据强度相差很大。这里把七种并排列出：已经观测到了什么、有哪些保留意见，以及目前的状态。', 'Common claims about quantum computers vary greatly in the strength of their evidence. Seven are laid out side by side: what has been observed, what reservations apply, and where things stand.'),
